ng on you so  you know I wanted to have the wonderful  stories in but also had that little  touch of realism by having people argue  about well is it true or isn't true  exactly how does  you know there's that famous quote from  the man who shot Liberty valance you  know when when truth and legend disagree  print the legend  so I print a legend but I you know hedge  my bets a little so but that's that's  been fun
 

